      "section_content": "Each GPIO has two 16-bit memory-mapped data registers: input and output data registers\n(GPIOx_IDR and GPIOx_ODR (x = A to H)).\nGPIOx_ODR stores the data to be output, it is read/write accessible. The data entered\nthrough the I/Os are stored into the input data register (GPIOx_IDR), a read-only register.",
